                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cea9928b-ae8a-3eb0-9da6-d6be9428993d",
                        "entry_id": "f17af1a9-9a68-30b2-85a0-6f95813559cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сумка или пояс с гнёздами для патронов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "635ac579-3a39-42e1-89a8-6509099130a4",
                                "sense_id": "cea9928b-ae8a-3eb0-9da6-d6be9428993d",
                                "text": "На голове была развалина какой-то шляпы, но ружьё новой системы было игрушечка, и ягдташ и патронташ, хотя истасканные, были наилучшей доброты."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6986d9d-8766-4a3f-a862-d0fe78c782fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "f17af1a9-9a68-30b2-85a0-6f95813559cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "cea9928b-ae8a-3eb0-9da6-d6be9428993d",
                        "target_lang_word": "bandoleer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bandoleer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8835020d-83cd-310b-a919-468022c9c59b",
                                        "entry_id": "95e51df1-4751-394f-91e2-ab9c90e4bd72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of bandolier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1df04353-32a5-4765-acb9-4c84fa2116a7",
                                                "sense_id": "8835020d-83cd-310b-a919-468022c9c59b",
                                                "text": "The ammunition bandoleer, containing 100 rounds of 7.62mm ammunition, is placed in this bracket. But a problem arose in this operation because the canvas and metal magazine requires zipping and unzipping to effect a change of bandoleers, a manual act which consumes too much time at a critical moment: during the assault, a gunner must avoid lulls in firing and maintain his proper alignment and firepower."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b33ed1e-3c75-4d66-aec5-2c3aa064aa66",
                                                "sense_id": "8835020d-83cd-310b-a919-468022c9c59b",
                                                "text": "Hastily Pak wrapped his poncho around his waist, tied it, then emptied the pouches of the bandoleer, scattering the last of their food on the ground. He emptied his water bottle and shoved it into a pouch in the bandoleer, then plunged the bandoleer into the river."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "487b8f64-9e87-4c43-b70a-e25781df2ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "8835020d-83cd-310b-a919-468022c9c59b",
                                                "text": "The original T4 bandoleer could not be fitted to the weapon directly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a15dc166-2a86-4b1b-80f7-75d1d0f3fde5",
                        "source_entry_id": "f17af1a9-9a68-30b2-85a0-6f95813559cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "cea9928b-ae8a-3eb0-9da6-d6be9428993d",
                        "target_lang_word": "bandolier",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bandolier",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "702d58fb-3db4-357c-a082-defab1e5c4d1",
                                        "entry_id": "4c96ff26-92a8-37c6-a4aa-51057a4e4f69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ammunition belt, worn over the shoulder, having loops or pockets for cartridges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9127fad-02a0-40b5-b405-e30dcbb753b3",
                                                "sense_id": "702d58fb-3db4-357c-a082-defab1e5c4d1",
                                                "text": "The vivid, untrammeled life appealed to him[…]; but he was wise and knew that once peace was established there would be no room in Cuba for the Sin Verguenza.\n “None better to face peril or adversity with, but a change is coming, and one cannot always wear the bandolier,” he said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c985a0e1-0f30-4175-a7c7-7d4b1976b3b3",
                                                "sense_id": "702d58fb-3db4-357c-a082-defab1e5c4d1",
                                                "text": "We had each bandoliers of cartridges."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "475477f0-03d2-4097-9d19-ae3379ce86a2",
                                                "sense_id": "702d58fb-3db4-357c-a082-defab1e5c4d1",
                                                "text": "[…] with the casual but combative look of the urban photographer, black T-shirt and baseball boots, twenty-pocketed waistcoat and bandolier of film."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a61373c-d202-40fc-a6d0-a14874c1c998",
                        "source_entry_id": "f17af1a9-9a68-30b2-85a0-6f95813559cd",
